<title>USA: Magnum Hunter names Chris Tong CFO.</title>
<headline>Magnum Hunter names Chris Tong CFO.</headline>
<dateline>IRVING, Texas 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Magnum Hunter Resources Inc said Tuesday that Chris Tong has been appointed senior vice president and chief financial officer effective August 18.</p>
<p>Her succeeds Steven Smart, who resigned to take a position with another company, said Magnum.</p>
<p>Magnum Hunter is an oil and natural gas exploration and development company.</p>
</text>
